                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Good elements:\nNice clean visuals\nGood distinction between enemies\nPleasing sense of speed\n\nBad elements:\n\"Blind\" jumps that kill you when you're struggling through a harder map. This is really terrible design.\nWeird difficulty - levels can be a joke, or very hard, or in between at random. No curve, which ruins any feeling of progression.\nSamey music and just not enough tracks\n\nUltimately though, the movement in this game is really weird and after a half hour of playing I still hadn't really nailed down what the distinction between attempts that failed or succeeded were. Got exhausted on level 27 where I died more than the preceeding 26 levels and just bored of the game.",
